 r thoughts and dive into exciting reads together.\nHere are the upcoming m
 eeting dates and titles:\nSeptember 26: Bobbi Lee: Indian Rebel\nOctober 
 24: Me before you\nNovember 21: The Riveter\nDecember 5: More than enough\
 nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is 
