DESCRIPTION:WRAP is for\nanyone\nlooking to strengthen their well-being—
 whether you’re supporting your mental health\, managing stress\, or simp
 ly wanting to feel more balanced and resilient in daily life. Participant
 s will receive a\nWRAP certificate\nupon program completion.\nIn an 8-wee
 k WRAP group\, individuals explore:\nself-care tools like peer connections
 \, relaxation and mindfulness techniques\, stress reduction strategies\, a
 nd more\nresources for keeping well and feeling better in difficult times.
 \nInterested in learning more? Drop in for the information session on\nSep
 tember 3\, 2:30-4:30 pm\n.\nThis WRAP Group meets\nevery Thursday\,\nonce
  a week for 8 weeks\, September 10 to October 29\n. Registration closes af
 ter week 3\, or when full.\nTTC Presto tickets will be provided.\nSnacks a
 nd refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will b
 e available at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerst
 ein Crisis Centre's WRAP initiative\n. Gerstein Crisis Centre is solely re
 sponsible for the protection of \npersonal information collected through t
 he program registration \nprocess.
