 s to Celebrate! 60 Years of Star Trek: A Merril Collection Exhibit\n!\nThi
 s exhibit looks at one of the most beloved and influential science fictio
 n franchises of all time. Star Trek has been boldly exploring brave new wo
 rlds and new frontiers for 60 years. Explore the history of the franchise 
 with our knowledgeable staff. The tour will also cover topics like the r
 ise of fan culture\, the campaign to Save Star Trek from cancellation and
  much more.\nCome celebrate the 60th anniversary of Star Trek with us!\nTh
 is will be a half-hour tour\, followed by time to ask questions and explor
 e the exhibit.
