SUMMARY:Job Search Tools
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T153000
UID:6a99740629a7dd0d6748c29e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class provides a brief overview of techniques and tools t
 o support job hunters. \n\nIn this class you will:\n- Consider how to get 
 your job search organized\n- Find & explore job postings\n- Learn about go
 vernment sites and services\n- Learn about TPL resources: Career Cruising\
 , Scott’s Business Directories\, LinkedIn Learning\n\nPrerequisites: Mou
 se and keyboarding skills required.\n\nInformation Collection Notice: The 
 personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libra
 ry under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). Th
 e information will only be used for event and program registration\, deliv
 ery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informati
 on can be directed to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-5981
 \, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Learning Centre\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99740629a7dd0d6748c29e
