  would like to see in the neighbourhood!  *\nTherapy dog visits with Rub
 y\nand her handler\, Denise\, will resume every other week\, beginning Fr
 iday\, June 26th.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participan
 ts. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nThis program is i
 n collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
