DESCRIPTION:This month's movie:\nBeetlejuice Beetlejuice\nThis movie is ra
 ted PG\nBeetlejuice is back! After an unexpected family tragedy\, three ge
 nerations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted b
 y Beetlejuice\, Lydia's life is turned upside down when her rebellious tee
 nage daughter\, Astrid\, discovers the mysterious model of the town in the
  attic and the portal to the Afterlife is accidentally opened. With troubl
 e brewing in both realms\, it's only a matter of time until someone says B
 eetlejuice's name three times and the mischievous demon returns to unleash
  his very own brand of mayhem.
