DESCRIPTION:This program is part of Fort York Library's\nEntrepreneur in R
 esidence\n(EIR) service.\nWhy is the #1 skill that will help you thrive as
  a newcomer entrepreneur networking? This workshop with Entrepreneur in Re
 sidence (Newcomer Focus)\, Jean Chow\, will show you how to build your ne
 tworking skills and help you achieve your professional and personal goals.
  Learn the true meaning of networking and why it’s not what you know and
  it’s not who you know.\nIn this session:\nGet outside your comfort zone
  and grow your confidence in meeting new people.\nEmploy strategies to net
 work effectively both in-person and on-line.\nGain a better understanding 
 of how networking can help you grow your business.\nCome early to network 
