UID:6aa979ca8cf597003f940418@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:While nuclear emergencies are unlikely\, it is important to un
 derstand the risks\, know how to stay informed\, and be prepared to take p
 rotective actions if needed. The Nuclear Emergency Preparedness session is
  aimed at increasing public awareness and household preparedness for nucle
 ar emergencies.\nThis free session facilitated by the\nToronto Emergency M
 anagement Division of the City of Toronto\nwill cover:\nWhy Toronto plans 
 for nuclear emergencies\nWhat nuclear emergency planning zones mean\nHow e
 mergency alerts and official information would be shared\nProtective actio
 ns you may be asked to take\nHow to prepare a household emergency plan and
  kit for your household\nAll are welcome! Free program. Register for a re
 minder. For more information\, please contact Guildwood branch at 416-396
 -8872.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
