 , build social connections\, and tell us\n about programs and services you
  would like to see in the neighbourhood!\nJoin us and make some crafts! Ex
 press your creativity throw Diamond painting\, a relaxing\, mosaic-style c
 raft where tiny resin "diamonds" are placed on a numbered adhesive canvas 
