BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Skyward Steps:Mixed Media 3D Dance of Freedom
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261110T150000
UID:6a3aed25414ef43d0097da6a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Skyward Steps is an innovative mixed-media dance performance w
 here dancers move freely across a three-dimensional ladder structure handc
 rafted from natural tree sticks. The ladder symbolizes growth\, connection
 \, and the journey between earth and sky. Through fluid movements\, climbi
 ng\, balancing\, and interaction with the organic structure\, performers c
 reate a living sculpture that blends nature\, art\, and motion. The 3D lad
 der becomes both a stage and a storytelling element\, expressing freedom\,
  creativity\, and harmony between humans and the natural world.\nThis is a
  Drop-In program for Adults and Seniors.\nNo registration required.\nSpace
  is limited. All materials are provided.
LOCATION:Locke
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3aed25414ef43d0097da6a
