 esidence\n(EIR) service.\nThis session\, the follow up to the November 3rd
  workshop\, is a hands-on workshop to help you identify\, analyze\, and s
 trategize an actionable plan on growing your network. This workshop\, with
  Entrepreneur in Residence (Newcomer Focus)\, Jean Chow\, will determine 
 your networking quotient as a baseline so that you will be able to measure
  improvements in your networking skills.\nIn this session:\nKnow your netw
 ork better by creating your network map.\nKnow how to blend your personal 
 brand with your minimum value proposition created in Week 2.\nIn a group t
 hink tank session\, you will have Identified a strategy on how to connect 
 with your POI – person of interest – from your relationship circle.\nC
 ome early to network from 6-6:30pm!\nTo apply for one-on-one consultations
