SUMMARY:Legal Oversight and Business Registration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T200000
UID:6a99bb80b88596143287d9a3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program is part of the Toronto Reference Library's\nEntre
 preneur in Residence\n(EIR) service.\nAt some point the business has to be
 come real on paper. This session will address the decisions that arise whe
 n choosing to operate as a sole proprietorship\, a partnership or a corpor
 ation\, as well as registering your business name in Ontario\, understandi
 ng your obligations around HST\, record-keeping and taxes. We'll also cove
 r the protections new owners most often skip such as basic contracts\, ins
 urance\, and how to protect your business name and brand. You'll leave kno
 wing exactly which steps apply to you and roughly what each one costs. Thi
 s session is general information\, not legal or tax advice.\nThe program i
 ncludes a short networking component\, providing participants with an oppo
 rtunity to connect with other entrepreneurs.\nRegistration recommended. Dr
 op-ins welcome until room capacity is reached.\nTo apply for one-on-one co
 nsultations with our resident entrepreneur\, Ryan\, please fill out the in
 -take form available at\ntpl.ca/eir\n. We begin accepting in-take forms on
  September 28\, 2026 until available slots are filled.\nInformation Collec
 tion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the To
 ronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(
 c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program re
 gistration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library hand
 les your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tp
 l.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Beeton Hall\, Ground Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99bb80b88596143287d9a3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
