SUMMARY:CRA Personal Finance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T153000
UID:6abd4454a85a2c00337c1e0d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Make the Most of Your Tax Return & Protect Yourself from Finan
 cial Scams\nA representative from the Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) will exp
 lain how filing your taxes can help you access benefits and credits you ma
 y be eligible to receive. The representative will also discuss how to rec
 ognize scams and fraud\, the different methods used by scammers\, how to p
 rotect your personal and financial information\, and what steps to take if
  you believe you have been targeted.  Learn about available programs\, e
 ligibility requirements\, and how to apply. Topics may include:\nCanada Gr
 oceries and Essentials Benefit (CGEB)\nCanada Child Benefit (CCB)\nCanada 
 Workers Benefit (CWB)\nDisability Tax Credit (DTC)\nChild Disability Benef
 it\nCanada Caregiver Credit\nEligibility for benefits and credits\nRegistr
 aion is required.
LOCATION:Richview\, Room A\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abd4454a85a2c00337c1e0d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
