UID:6ab6d22565abe8002a7c147d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program is part of the York Woods Library’s\nEntreprene
 ur in Residence\n(EIR) service.\nThe 8-week program closes with a networki
 ng-focused workshop where participants pitch their one-page plan to peers 
 and invited community partners. The session explores how to build a person
 al board of advisors made up of mentors\, peers\, and champions. Participa
 nts leave with clear next steps\, including one-on-one consultations\, ong
 oing supports\, and ways to stay connected with the community they have bu
 ilt.\nDrop-in\nTo apply for one-on-one consultations with our resident ent
 repreneur\, Leo\, please fill out the in-take form available at\ntpl.ca/ei
 r\n. We begin accepting in-take forms on September 28\, 2026 until availab
 le slots are filled.
