 thena Liu\, June Hayward acts on impulse: she steals Athena's masterpiece 
 and claims it as her own. Rebranded as the elusive "Juniper Song\," June m
 ust navigate a minefield of social media scrutiny and looming exposure in 
 this dark thriller about literary theft and identity.\nPick up a physical 
 copy at the branch before the meeting\, or find copies through our website
  in various formats. Registration is required and begins Aug. 27\, 2026.\n
