DESCRIPTION:Drop in for a bookish chat with fellow readers. No specific r
 eading required!\nLibrarians will share their favourite books on a theme. 
 Then we will have a casual chat about books!\nJoin us to find inspiration 
 for your next read\, share your favourite books\, and get to know other re
 aders.\nSeptember 2\nnd\n– Adapted for Screen or Stage\nOctober 7\nth\n
 – Thrilling and Spooky Fall Reads\nNovember 4\nth\n– Fun Formats: Book
 s Featuring Letters\, Texts\, Verse\, and Ephemera\nDecember\n2\nnd\n
 –\nBy The Water\nImage source: Canva
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3 on the 2nd floor
