BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Building Your Website with WordPress Session 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T200000
UID:6aaea67bf9ed2e003851e601@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In today's world\, having a personal website is essential for 
 many reasons and especially to support careers and small businesses. Learn
  how to use WordPress to build your own e-commerce or small business websi
 te.\nSession 4: E-COMMERCE\, SECURE PAYMENTS & LAUNCH\nIn this final\, pi
 votal session\, we transform the websites into fully functional online sto
 res. We will cover\nthe comprehensive setup of WooCommerce\, including pro
 duct listing and category management\, with\na major focus on Stripe payme
 nt integration for secure transactions. The session concludes with a final
 \nsite review\, troubleshooting\, and a collaborative Q&A to ensure each p
 articipant feels confident\nmanaging and growing their new online store.\n
 KEYWORDS: WOOCOMMERCE SETUP · PRODUCT LISTING · STRIPE PAYMENT INTEGRATI
 ON · SITE\nREVIEW · Q&A\nLearners who complete all the courses will earn
  a certificate of completion.\n(\nPlease arrive a few minutes early.\nPlea
 se cancel as soon as possible if you are no longer available to attend\n.)
 \nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is
  collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, 
 sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for 
