 ill be screening the following films in Program Room A:\nOctober 7:\nSingi
 n' in the Rain\nOctober 14:\nCoco\nOctober 21:\nThe Social Network\nOctobe
 r 28:\nThe King's Speech\nNovember 4:\nEternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mi
 nd\nNovember 11:\nLady Bird\nNovember 18:\nJuno\nNovember 25:\nThe Breakfa
 st Club\nDecember 2:\nMy Cousin Vinny\nDecember 9:\nSecondhand Lions\nDece
 mber 16:\nBlack Swan\nDecember 23:\nScrooged\nDecember 30:\nThe Pursuit of
  Happyness\nDrop in. No registration required.\nSnacks and refreshments ar
 e provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at th
